/// Campaign: one platform, channel, network, market and tier each (A-71). Derived on load: channel_name / network_name (the Filters tree), status / market / tier / objective names, campaign_label (the column the campaign table and movers use, so a table click is told apart from the Campaigns slicer).
table dim_campaign
	lineageTag: dd4928cc-32b1-579a-95a1-8ce2e1f56f82

